          "value": "N/A (computed at epoch transitions)",
          "description": "A fixed-size vector of validator indices covering the full proposer lookahead period, starting from the beginning of the current epoch. With MIN_SEED_LOOKAHEAD = 1, this covers 2 full epochs (current + next)."
