        "name": "ECDSA Signature Verification Algorithm",
        "description": "Defines the step-by-step ECDSA signature verification algorithm for secp256r1. After input validation passes, the algorithm computes the modular inverse of s, recovers a point R', checks if R' is the point at infinity, and compares the x-coordinate of R' with r modulo n.",
